<title>UK: Bank Austria sets 500 mln rand zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets 500 mln rand zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers WestMerchant (books) and Bank Austria.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUSTRIA AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    04.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  26.62     PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    26.40     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMS US/GB/ZA/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.13	SELL CONC  0.22	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
